<title>USA: Calgon Carbon director to retire.</title>
<headline>Calgon Carbon director to retire.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calgon Carbon Corp said Monday Roger H. Zanitsch will not stand for re-election to its board of directors when his term expires in April in order to devote more time to personal interests.</p>
<p>The company said Zanitsch, 53, retired from Calgon Carbon in December 1994. He has been a director since 1985.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
